    "concept": "The solution centers on “mindful minimalism,” blending Scandinavian simplicity with organic warmth. The logo combines a soft, custom sans-serif wordmark with an abstract symbol (e.g., a horizon line or a chair looking shape) to evoke openness. A warm, earthy color palette of oatmeal and terracotta replaces cold neutrals, creating an inviting yet modern feel. Typography pairs a geometric sans-serif with rounded edges for approachability and a minimalist serif for storytelling. Photography focuses on airy, naturally wide spaces to evoke the minimalist aesthetic. Sustainability is conveyed subtly through material close-ups (reclaimed wood grains, vegan leather) and artisan stories rather than overt symbols.",
